# AGENTS.md — AI Life Time Machine project rules

- Active scope: `.ai-life-time-machine/project-profile.json`.
- Read B00 baseline and current repository before proposing architecture.
- Use `projectctl.py --repo . ready`; implement only a ready Batch.
- Load the matching `.agents/skills/<skill>/SKILL.md` and one Batch reference.
- Do not create parallel services when an existing capability can be adapted.
- Every Requirement needs source, symbol, test, runtime evidence and commit.
- Never access production customer media, secrets or irreversible infrastructure.
- Preserve illustrative-not-predictive, consent, child, privacy, deletion, provenance, no-consequential-biometric-decisioning, finance and tenant controls.
- Run `verify_release.py` before claiming completion.
